Bug reports and suggestions are welcome on the GitHub issue tracker.

[h2]About TLB MilSim[/h2]
We are a MilSim unit, and this mod was built mainly for our own operations. We are sharing it in case it is useful to anyone else, and because we would like to hear suggestions and ideas.

If you have one, or you hit a problem, come and tell us on our Discord.

[url=https://discord.gg/TLBMilSim]discord.gg/TLBMilSim[/url]

